<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/a-is-for-the-a1c-test> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "A is for the A1C test" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "a-is-for-the-a1c-test" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Screening" ;
    dmo:statement "The A1C test shows your average blood glucose level over the past 3 months. This is different from the blood glucose checks you do every day. The higher your A1C number, the higher your blood glucose levels have been during the past 3 months. High levels of blood glucose can harm your heart, blood vessels, kidneys, feet, and eyes." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "The A1C test shows your average blood glucose level over the past 3 months. This is different from the blood glucose checks you do every day. The higher your A1C number, the higher your blood glucose levels have been during the past 3 months. High levels of blood glucose can harm your heart, blood vessels, kidneys, feet, and eyes." ;
