<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/learn-to-manage-stress> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Learn to manage stress" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "learn-to-manage-stress" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Lifestyle" ;
    dmo:statement "Managing diabetes is not always easy. Feeling stressed, sad, lonely, or angry is common when you are living with diabetes. You may know what to do to stay healthy but may have trouble sticking with your plan over time. Long-term stress can raise your blood glucose and blood pressure, but you can learn ways to lower your stress. Try deep breathing, gardening, taking a walk, doing yoga, talking with a loved one, working on a hobby, or listening to your favorite music." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Managing diabetes is not always easy. Feeling stressed, sad, lonely, or angry is common when you are living with diabetes. You may know what to do to stay healthy but may have trouble sticking with your plan over time. Long-term stress can raise your blood glucose and blood pressure, but you can learn ways to lower your stress. Try deep breathing, gardening, taking a walk, doing yoga, talking with a loved one, working on a hobby, or listening to your favorite music." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/niddk-cardiovascular-disease> .

