<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/s-is-for-stop-smoking> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "S is for stop smoking" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "s-is-for-stop-smoking" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Lifestyle" ;
    dmo:statement "Quitting smoking is especially important for people with diabetes because both smoking and diabetes narrow blood vessels, so your heart has to work harder. E-cigarettes aren’t a safe option either." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Quitting smoking is especially important for people with diabetes because both smoking and diabetes narrow blood vessels, so your heart has to work harder. E-cigarettes aren’t a safe option either." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/niddk-cardiovascular-disease> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/statins-can-reduce-the-risk-of-having-a-heart-attack-or-stroke-in-some-people-with-diabetes> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Statins can reduce the risk of having a heart attack or stroke in some people with diabetes" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "statins-can-reduce-the-risk-of-having-a-heart-attack-or-stroke-in-some-people-with-diabetes" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Statins can reduce the risk of having a heart attack or stroke in some people with diabetes. In addition, certain diabetes medicines have been shown to reduce the risk of heart attacks and death in patients at very high risk of having a heart attack. Talk with your doctor to find out whether taking a statin or a diabetes medicine that reduces heart attack risk is right for you." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Statins can reduce the risk of having a heart attack or stroke in some people with diabetes. In addition, certain diabetes medicines have been shown to reduce the risk of heart attacks and death in patients at very high risk of having a heart attack. Talk with your doctor to find out whether taking a statin or a diabetes medicine that reduces heart attack risk is right for you." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/niddk-cardiovascular-disease> .

